{"_id":"6a2ffab72204ffbc59e5a869","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"Z-inS5OKdXi6yveKgxMeC","description":"# Streamlit\n\nStreamlit is an open-source Python framework for building interactive data applications with minimal code. A Streamlit app is a Python script where each widget (slider, dropdown, text input) triggers a rerun of the script with the new value. It is popular for rapidly prototyping and sharing data analysis tools and ML demos.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Tutorials","url":"https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/tutorials","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb60"},{"type":"article","title":"Getting Started with Streamlit","url":"https://www.pythonguis.com/tutorials/getting-started-with-streamlit/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb61"},{"type":"video","title":"Streamlit: The Fastest Way To Build Python Apps?","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D0D4Pa22iG0","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb62"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T13:14:31.030Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/Z-inS5OKdXi6yveKgxMeC.md"}